<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Dec 10.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Dec 10.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on December 9.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>			     Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name		   Yield     Close</p>
<p>1   Schroder Intl	 10.37	2.32</p>
<p>2   Prime Credit Tr	9.90	0.99</p>
<p>3   Villa World	    9.73	1.13</p>
<p>4   Prop Income Inv	9.58	1.06</p>
<p>5   BT Prop Trust	  9.49	1.72</p>
<p>6   Indu Property	  9.38	0.97</p>
<p>7   MT Leyshon Gold	9.36	2.67</p>
<p>8   Colonial Mutual	9.20	1.13</p>
<p>9   Aust Tour		8.82	0.85</p>
<p>10  Centro Prop	    8.67	2.25</p>
<p>11  Gandel Retail Tr     8.67	0.90</p>
<p>12  Armstrong Retail     8.57	0.77</p>
<p>13  Gen Prop Tr	    8.41	2.39</p>
<p>14  Barclays Mirvac	8.40	1.31</p>
<p>15  Equitilink	     8.33	0.60</p>
<p>16  Westfield Trust	8.26	2.35</p>
